          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka ŋikanikaomwon ipukat Asaria Yudaya, kisyak Menaem lokoku a Gadi akipuka Isirael, kipuka Isirael alo Samaria ŋikaru ŋitomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon. Abu iŋes anakiyar keŋ a daadaŋ nyeki akitiya ŋasecisya ŋuna ekote ŋuna arikokinia Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat Ŋisirael nasecit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu erwosit Pul ŋolo ka Asiriya torem akwap a Ŋisirael. Inak Menaem ŋolo arae erwosit a Isirael ŋitalantae aliput ŋulu a esilipa neni a Pul, ikotere kiŋarakinia Pul iŋes, torubak ipukat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipogoununu Menaem ŋisiliŋa ŋulu alalak aneni a Ŋisirael a ŋulu abarak, tolimok ŋinituŋanan alemun ŋicekelin ŋatomonikan ŋulu a esilipa, yarae neni ke erwosit ka Asiriya. Aŋun, abu erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya toboŋo nakwap keŋ toesik akwap a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Menaem ŋuluce daadaŋ ka ŋuna daadaŋ etiyat iŋes, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Menaem totwana, tonukae neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ. Kilunyokin Pekaia ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
