          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomonikan ipukat Asaria Yudaya, kisyak Pekaia lokoku a Menaem akipuka Isirael alo Samaria, kipuka iŋes Isirael ŋikaru ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
